flowchart TD
    User([User]) --> UI[React / Flutter Client]
    UI -->|POST /api/v1/agent/stream<br/>SSE response| API[FastAPI Ingress]

    subgraph LangGraph Orchestrator
        API --> CacheGate{Semantic Cache Gate<br/>Redis VSS}
        CacheGate -->|Hit| FastReturn[Fast Return]
        CacheGate -->|Miss| Plan[Node 1: plan_node]
        Plan --> Execute[Node 2: execute_node]
        Execute --> Reflect[Node 3: reflect_node]
        Reflect -->|Retry| Plan
        Execute --> Summarize[Node 4: summarize_node]
    end

    subgraph FastMCP [MCP Tool Server]
        Plan -.->|get_schema| MCPSchema[Schema Context]
        Execute -.->|execute_query| MCPExec[Execute Query]
        Summarize -.->|generate_chart| MCPChart[Chart Config]
        Summarize -.->|generate_flowchart| MCPFlow[Mermaid Diagram]
        Summarize -.->|explain_data| MCPExplain[Plain Text Explanation]
        Summarize -.->|analyze_data| MCPAnalyze[Grounded Analytics]
        Summarize -.->|verify_response| MCPVerify[Final Verification]
        
        MCPExec --> Guardrails[AST Validation + Cost Gate + PII Masking]
        Guardrails --> Sandbox[PgBouncer Pool]
        Sandbox --> Postgres[(PostgreSQL Replica)]
        MCPSchema --> Postgres
    end
    
    CacheGate --> Redis[(Redis Engine)]
